#24300
Snake Valley Credits~
Snake Valley is an experience area for level 25-49.  Groups for
the lowers levels of course.  The area consist of Large Anacondas,
Average Anacondas, Cottonmouths, Black-racers etc.  There
is a waterfall which is a Death-Trap of course!  
At the end of the zone you come to a small pond with baby 
anacondas and a mother anaconda.  The mother anaconda as +3 dr
leg eq and 4x Charges through sanc.  Thought she would be fun. :)

Diamond
